audit('232','reframe-ready',[d['datasetId']],'The2026 GWAS Diversity Monitor headline remains heavily concentrated in European-labelled participant entries; it is context for model development, not a census of genomic AI training.','Whose genomes are represented before a model is built?','The original question requires unavailable model-by-cohort provenance. A carefully labelled baseline shows the source-data representation problem without claiming measured AI bias.',ai='context',search=[m.SOURCES['planet-gwas']['url'],m.SOURCES['planet-gwas-methods']['url'],'https://www.ebi.ac.uk/gwas/docs/ancestry-data/'])

